    "body": "### Join codes leak into PostHog events\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`sanitizeCaptureEvent` rewrites URL and path properties and drops `data-code`, but it never scrubs `$title`, `$prev_pageview_title`, or autocapture `$el_text` / `$elements` text. The player route title embeds the join code, and the host copy-link control still renders the raw join URL without `ph-no-capture` (`JoinCodeBadge` is also unprotected). Every `/game/$code` pageview and those clicks therefore send the live code as event properties, which this change set out to prevent.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 578227b4-4c43-4476-bcf7-56729885e234 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nsrc/lib/analytics/posthog.ts#L54-L96\nsrc/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103\nsrc/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\n\n- [`src/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623/src/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103)\n- [`src/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623/src/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.co