    "body": "### Join codes leak on host routes\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`redactText` only substitutes params found in known pathnames, so a bare join code on `/game/host/$gameId` or `/game/tv/$gameId` is left intact. Autocapture still walks ancestors, and those nodes' `$el_text` / `$elements_chain` include the lobby code. `ph-no-capture` on the code node does not strip that ancestor text, so join codes can still reach PostHog.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: c52861b7-f585-4135-8458-86a01e37fa85 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nsrc/lib/analytics/posthog.ts#L71-L77\nsrc/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`src/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948/src/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\n\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n",
